#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I'm \"Lucinda Lavish\" - the Deluxe Edition itself."
msgstr "Je suis « Lucinda Lavish », l'Édition Deluxe en personne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/16
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Which... isn't really anything at all."
msgstr "Ce qui... ne veut pas dire grand-chose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, what the hell are you?"
msgstr "Ouais, qu'est-ce que tu es, bon sang ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Everything else around here has so much familiarity with you humans."
msgstr "Tout le reste ici a tellement l'habitude de vous, les humains."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "But it seems like I have to make my own relationship with you."
msgstr "Mais on dirait que je dois construire ma propre relation avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds good to me."
msgstr "Ça me va très bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only if you want to."
msgstr "Seulement si tu en as envie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Okay. Next time I see you I'll have some goodies for you."
msgstr "D'accord. La prochaine fois, j'aurai des petites douceurs pour toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "See you around, lover."
msgstr "À bientôt, mon cœur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Oh, I do want that. Believe me."
msgstr "Oh, j'en ai envie. Crois-moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: lucinda_lavish/lucinda_begin/0/whatami/c-9/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I've got no other... reason... for..."
msgstr "Je n'ai aucune autre... raison... de..."

