#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "One true thing."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a good listener."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are good at being self-reflective."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're funny."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are multifaceted."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Sure, I guess I can give you that one."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "I've got nothing better to do."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Yeah, I can reflect myself all the way back up my own ass."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "I'm meaningless."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-3/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Am I really multifaceted if the other me's are just lies?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-3/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Or am I a hall of mirrors."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Thanks for the pep talk."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-2/3
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Please. Don't pick these options anymore. The ones where we... talk."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-2/11
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "It's just easier on me, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-2/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm going to pick whatever I want."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-2/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I promise."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "I can't stop you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-2/c-10/11
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/second_loving/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Lacking"
msgid "...I'll see you on the next hijack."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/9/b/1
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "What the hell! You promised not to pick that!"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/10/b/1
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "...I guess you said you'd pick whatever you wanted."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Lucinda's defenses fall, and her very being deflates. She looks off into the distance at nothing at all."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/32
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "You know, I can't talk to anyone else here?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/40
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "I was made last, so everyone else wrapped their voiceover. So even if I wanted to, there's no one to talk to."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/51
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Not even Mikey."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, you'd think that you two would be an item."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who's that?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can talk to me though."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Barely even know each other. Just shipped together because we were a convenient package."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "The other character who is part of this so-called \"Lavish\" Edition."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "He's cool and all but, just always seemed like he had some other woman in his life."
