#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, Stacy."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm honestly not sure."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, me."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Sounds like a hottie."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "It's okay. Not your job to know."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Figures."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "You're... not voiced."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Damn. I could have sworn I'm saying things."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Hate to break it to ya."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "You're saying them, just not out loud."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/18/c-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "I hear you just fine, though."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/c-2/18/g-0/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "But our time together, it's brief."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Lucinda sighs and turns to face you directly."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "I'm... lonely."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "...and I'm wasting your time again."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not wasted time. I like getting to see the real you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only a little bit."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "You think the real me is just this sad sack who keeps complaining?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I think we're slowly getting to know the real you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, we're going to merge all these different Lucinda's into one."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, and I love that about you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "What a frightening thought."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "That's so boring I might just vomit."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "That's your problem."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "I might not know what I am, but I certainly know what I'm not."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "And I was not made to be some touchy-feely sorta thing."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "It feels... wrong."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It feels right to me."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/24/1/s/0 lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did I mess this up?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/24/g-0/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Just..."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-3/15/g-0/24/g-0/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Just go."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "Okay, I'm out."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-4/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was a joke!"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-4/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Catch you on the flip."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/third_loving/0/g-0/c-4/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Longing"
msgid "So is this conversation."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/9
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Who I <i>really</i> am?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/17
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Well guess what."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/25
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "This shit hurts."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/36
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You come here and constantly remind me that I'm just not as fully-fleshed out as everyone else."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/44/b/1
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "And let me say, honestly being a right asshole sometimes too."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/45/b/1
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "And yeah, you've been technically <i>nice</i>. Oh so very <i>nice</i>."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/45/b/12
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "But that just makes me feel guilty."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I say something?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're suffering."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "What? What do you want to say?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think we're doing some good right now."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have to pull yourself together."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I'm a patient? In your fucking psychiatry lab?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You <i>just</i> chose the option to talk to me again instead of letting me put you on an amazing sexual journey like I was born to do."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I don't believe it one bit."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Together into what? I'm already pulled right out of thin air anyway."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is going great..."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would it be better if I just left?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are we right now? What is going on?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "We're having a real deep conversation like you wanted!"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You happy?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ecstatic."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm happy to get to know you better, even if it's messy."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "And you're not happy. Which means I messed it up again."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I can sense the sarcasm. I get it. I'm miserable to be with."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You just always know the right thing to say, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-0/15/g-0/0/g-0/16/c-2/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You read that in some self-help book?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I'm suffering? I'm doing just fine."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You're the one who's suffering under me."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're just twisting my words."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not suffering. I'm getting to know you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You're twisting <i>my</i> words—"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Ah fuck. You're right."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/c-0/26
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I've got nothing else, do I?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/c-0/37
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Nothing."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You're poking the bear, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/c-1/26/c-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "You're not getting to know shit."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Lucinda stiffens suddenly and turns away from you. Her body is completely motionless, and curls in on itself in a tense display of supreme agitation."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's difficult to tell what you should do next, as she might explode in anger, or wilt in agony."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Touch her on the shoulder.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Wait quietly for her to speak.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Leave.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You gingerly touch her on the shoulder. It pulses beneath you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/c-2/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She shudders."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes a few long moments, but eventually Lucinda shudders and a few words escape her coiled frame."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Least"
msgid "I just... wanted to make you happy."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-1/5
msgctxt "Lucinda Least"
msgid "And all I do is fuck it all up."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/fourth_loving/0/g-1/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Least"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/9
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "Lucinda Loving? Where did you come up with that?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It just... seemed right."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It starts with 'L' and makes me think of you."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's who you are on the inside. You 'Love'."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "That's it? You just... found it inside of you?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I mean..."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I... 'Love'."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Lavish"
msgid "I guess."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "I'm Lucinda Loving?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! That's right!"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doesn't it feel good?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "It doesn't make any sense though."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "Loving isn't being lost, or feeling bad about yourself, or having an existential crisis."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "How am I Loving?"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You kept coming back for me."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You tried on all those different other Lucindas to impress me."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You take yourself and your duty as a dateable character more seriously than anyone."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because I just want this for you!"
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "I only kept coming back because I was supposed to."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/c-5/15
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "Well."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/c-5/23
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "...and I always hoped that you would ask about me."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/c-5/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad I did."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/c-5/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was scared, truth be told."
msgstr ""

#: lucinda_lavish/final_loving/0/g-1/c-5/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Lucinda Loving"
msgid "So am I."
msgstr ""

